# Admin UI defaults (LIS)

## Tables

- Default table look: plain text cells like «Результаты» / «Мои группы» — class `row-click`, clickable rows for open/edit.
- Do **not** put `<input>` inside data cells by default; edit via modal or side form on row click.
- Search fields, filter `<select>`, date filters, and form panels stay as normal inputs/dropdowns.
- Per-block exceptions only when Andrey asks.

## Buttons

- Default action buttons: class `btn` (same look as «Скачать шаблон» in «Полётная ведомость»).
- Delete / destructive: keep `btn danger` unchanged.
- Avoid `btn main` for ordinary actions unless explicitly requested for a primary CTA.
- Excel import: one button «Загрузить из файла» → hidden `<input type="file">` → auto-upload on Open (no visible file field + separate upload button).

## Dropdowns / suggest lists

- Background of **every** opened dropdown / suggest panel must match the **background color of the trigger cell/field**, at **15% opacity** (alpha `0.15`).
- Do not invent a separate opaque panel color; derive from the opener (`input`, `select`, table cell, chip field).
- Prefer `color-mix(in srgb, <trigger-bg> 15%, transparent)` or the same RGB with `alpha: 0.15`. If the trigger has no explicit bg, use the computed background of that control.
- Applies to native-styled custom lists (`staff-suggest`, filter menus, autocomplete) — not only `<select>`.

## Example FIO in templates

- Never use real names from user-filled tables (staff, cadets, distributions, etc.) as examples.
- Always use fictional placeholders: **Иванов Иван Иванович**, **Петров Пётр Петрович**, **Сидоров Сидор Сидорович**.
- If more names are needed, invent additional fictional ones — do not copy from production data.
